#: ../../source/markdown-toc_README.md:76
msgid "**Safe!**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/markdown-toc_README.md:78
msgid ""
"Won't mangle markdown in code examples in gfm code blocks that other TOC "
"generators mistake as being actual headings (this happens when markdown "
"headings are show in _examples_, meaning they arent' actually headings "
"that should be in the toc. Also happens with yaml and coffee-script "
"comments, or any comments that use `#`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/markdown-toc_README.md:79
msgid ""
"Won't mangle front-matter, or mistake front-matter properties for "
"headings like other TOC generators"
msgstr ""

